00:08:49.720 --> 00:09:03.960
And what was what was happening there was a lot of people were kind of interested in what we now think of as biohacking or this idea that you can like build up all of these metrics about yourself in order to be kind of the most optimized or the best version of yourself.

96
00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:10.600
And so they were building dashboards and they were building tools to kind of help them do that and using technology on the way to help with the tracking.

